# Build / compile artifacts for the zkVM spike.
# Each backend is its own Cargo workspace (and some pull in non-standard
# toolchains), so build output lands in `target/` dirs at several depths.

# Rust / Cargo build output (matches zkvm/target and every backend's target/)
target/

# Generated proving artifacts (proofs, keys) produced by running the backends.
# These live outside target/ for some backends (e.g. openvm aztec-test).
*.proof
*.vk
*.pk

# Cargo.lock files ARE tracked intentionally (reproducible builds) — do not ignore.
